{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":19,"code":"PSA","name":"Psalms","testament":"OT"},"chapter":58,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"d","content":["To the chief Musician, Altaschith, Michtam of David. "]},{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PSA 58:1"},"Do ye indeed speak righteousness, O congregation? do ye judge uprightly, O ye sons of men? ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:1"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PSA 58:2"},"Yea, in heart ye work wickedness; ye weigh the violence of your hands in the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:2"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PSA 58:3"},"The wicked are estranged from the womb: they go astray as soon as they be born, speaking lies. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:3"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PSA 58:4"},"Their poison ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," like the poison of a serpent: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["they are "]},"like the deaf adder ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that"]}," stoppeth her ear; ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:4"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PSA 58:5"},"Which will not hearken to the voice of charmers, charming never so wisely. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:5"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PSA 58:6"},"Break their teeth, O God, in their mouth: break out the great teeth of the young lions, O LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:6"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PSA 58:7"},"Let them melt away as waters ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," run continually: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["when "]},"he bendeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his bow to shoot"]}," his arrows, let them be as cut in pieces. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:7"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PSA 58:8"},"As a snail ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["which"]}," melteth, let ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["every one of them "]},"pass away: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["like"]}," the untimely birth of a woman, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that "]},"they may not see the sun. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:8"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PSA 58:9"},"Before your pots can feel the thorns, he shall take them away as with a whirlwind, both living, and in ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," wrath. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:9"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PSA 58:10"},"The righteous shall rejoice when he seeth the vengeance: he shall wash his feet in the blood of the wicked. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:10"}]},{"type":"para","marker":"q1","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PSA 58:11"},"So that a man shall say, Verily ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," a reward for the righteous: verily he is a God that judgeth in the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PSA 58:11"}]}]}
